    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88541" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσαν-αιρέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lift up besides</i>:—
				Med.
			, <i>take upon oneself besides</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.28
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>destroy besides</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τἀληθές</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1172b1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>APr.</u>
				62a3
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> of an
			oracle, <i>give an answer besides</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				461e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.403c
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τινὶ στεφανηφορεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					21.54
				</span></i>
			.</div>
